        "created_at": "2022-05-01T06:40:17.876Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don’t think you could be Modular: Divided, actually. Modular says you don’t get any Abilities of your other Archetype, and Divided uses Abilities in order to set up and switch between your forms. You would still only get to the “pick Powers” step.</p>\n<p>You could be a Divided Form-Changer, presumably locking a lot of your shapes behind multiple forms. I kind of want to try that now.</p>",
